<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - StorMedia said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - StorMedia said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded StorMedia Inc to buy from outperform, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/4 to 21-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
